---
import LegalPage from '../components/LegalPage.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<LegalPage title="Privacy Policy" description={`How ${site.name} collects, uses and protects personal information.`} updated="September 2026">
  <h2>Who we are</h2>
  <p>
    This website is operated by {site.name} (“Axisys”, “we”, “us”). This policy explains what personal information we collect
    through this website, how we use it and the choices you have.
  </p>

  <h2>Information we collect</h2>
  <p>We only collect information you choose to give us, when you:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>send an enquiry or quote request — name, email, phone number, company, project location and project details;</li>
    <li>apply for a job — name, contact details, location, role, experience, portfolio link, CV and any message you include.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    Like most websites, our hosting provider automatically records basic technical data such as IP address, browser type and the
    pages requested. This is used to keep the site secure and working properly.
  </p>

  <h2>How we use your information</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>to respond to your enquiry and prepare proposals or quotes;</li>
    <li>to assess job applications and contact candidates;</li>
    <li>to protect the website against spam and misuse;</li>
    <li>to meet legal and regulatory obligations.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>We do not sell your personal information, and we do not use it for unrelated marketing without your consent.</p>

  <h2>Cookies</h2>
  <p>This website does not use advertising or analytics cookies.</p>

  <h2>Sharing</h2>
  <p>
    Your information is shared only with service providers that help us run this website and our email (such as our hosting
    provider), and only as needed to provide those services, or where required by law.
  </p>

  <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
  <p>
    We keep enquiries for as long as needed to respond and manage any resulting project, and job applications for up to 12
    months unless you ask us to delete them sooner.
  </p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>
    Depending on where you live, you may have the right to access, correct or delete your personal information, or to object to
    how we use it. To make a request, contact us through our <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
  <p>We may update this policy from time to time. The latest version will always be published on this page.</p>
</LegalPage>
